MACRO                                                                           
WY2000P8. PROC                                                                  
                                                                                
*---  ADJUST TWO DATE FIELDS IN YY-MM FORMAT (4/5 DIGITS)                       
*---  SO DATES BETWEEN 1950-2049 COME IN ASCENDING SEQUENCE.                    
*---  VALUE ZERO IS CONSIDERED A NON-DATE AND NOT ADJUSTED.                     
                                                                                
     IF TMP1-YYMM NOT ZERO AND +                                                
        TMP1-YYMM < 9999                                                        
       IF TMP1-YYMM < 5000                                                      
         TMP1-YYMM = TMP1-YYMM + 5000                                           
       ELSE                                                                     
         TMP1-YYMM = TMP1-YYMM - 5000                                           
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
     IF TMP2-YYMM NOT ZERO AND +                                                
        TMP2-YYMM < 9999                                                        
         TMP2-YYMM = TMP2-YYMM + 5000                                           
       ELSE                                                                     
         TMP2-YYMM = TMP2-YYMM - 5000                                           
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
